    "tex": "$\\ce{Cu^2+}$，$\\ce{Pb^2+}$，$\\ce{Cd^2+}$",
    "grading": "すべて選ぶ{$\\ce{Cu^2+}$|$\\ce{Zn^2+}$|$\\ce{Pb^2+}$|$\\ce{Fe^2+}$|$\\ce{Cd^2+}$|$\\ce{Ni^2+}$}=1,3,5"
